import json,re,sys
from pathlib import Path
root=Path(sys.argv[1]);data={}
CASES={
 'new-level':('Taking stairs to depth 31','The Borg holds an object-detection stamp for panel 0 from the previous level. On a depth change the other per-panel flags (walls, traps, doors, evil) are cleared but the object flag is not: the new level\'s panel still counts as detected and the Borg skips casting detect objects there. The correction clears it with the others; the wall flag is the witness that the pass ran.'),
 'same-level':('Control: no depth change','With the depth unchanged nothing is cleared in either version. The complete logs are byte-identical.')}
for mode,(label,explanation) in CASES.items():
 item={'label':label,'explanation':explanation}
 for phase in ('before','after'):
  raw=(root/f'{phase}-{mode}.log').read_text()
  entry={'raw':raw,'passed':'native-c/detectcarry-219 finished: 1/1 passed' in raw}
  for tag,key in (('SETUP olddepth=','setup'),('STATE ','state'),('OUTCOME ','outcome')):
   match=re.search(re.escape(tag)+r'(.*)',raw)
   entry[key]={k:int(v) for k,v in re.findall(r'(\w+)=(-?\d+)',match[1])} if match else None
  item[phase]=entry
 data[mode]=item
html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Object detection carried over to the new level</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f4f1ea;color:#253a3c;font:18px/1.6 system-ui}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:32px 24px}h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.2}h2{font-size:24px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd6d0;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}.cards .card{border-top:6px solid #648e80}.num{font-size:34px;font-weight:750}select,button{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #aabdb5;border-radius:7px;background:white}button{cursor:pointer;margin:14px 8px 0 0}button.active{background:#24685d;color:white}.summary{background:#e6eee6;padding:20px;border-left:5px solid #377367}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:13px/1.5 monospace;max-height:330px;overflow:auto}details{background:white;padding:20px;margin:20px 0}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:650px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:30px}}</style><main><p>Recorded native level-change passes</p><h1>Object detection carried over to the new level</h1><p>When the Borg takes stairs, the new-level pass clears the per-panel flags that remember where walls, traps, doors and evil were already detected. The object-detection flag was left out of that loop, and panel flags are positions: the same panel on the new level therefore looked already-detected, so the Borg skipped casting detect objects there — on a level it had never scanned. The correction clears it with the others.</p><section class="card"><label for="scenario">Choose a recorded situation</label><br><select id="scenario"></select><p id="explanation"></p><br><button data-step="0">The planted flags</button><button data-step="1">After the pass</button></section><div class="cards"><section id="original" class="card"><h2>Original</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p><p class="action"></p></section><section id="compared" class="card"><h2>Corrected</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p><p class="action"></p></section></div><p class="summary" id="outcome"></p><h2>What the controls establish</h2><p>With no depth change, nothing is cleared in either version and the logs match byte for byte — the correction changes only the new-level case. The wall flag, cleared by both variants on a depth change, is the witness that the pass ran.</p><details><summary>Experiment conditions and limits</summary><p>Native Human Warrior, seed 1000, glowing constructed arena, declared depth change 30 to 31. The per-panel object and wall flags are planted before the pass in the state a detect-objects cast on the previous level would have left — recorded as a fixture intervention. The production update pass runs directly; the tracked flags are read back, nothing is cast in the game.</p></details><details><summary>Recorded native output</summary><h3>Original</h3><pre id="original-log"></pre><h3>Corrected</h3><pre id="compared-log"></pre></details><p>Canonical report: <a href="https://github.com/diegoami/neo-angband-tracker/issues/219">issue219</a>.</p></main><script>
const data=__DATA__;let step=1;const select=document.getElementById('scenario');for(const [key,c] of Object.entries(data)){let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=key;o.textContent=c.label;select.append(o)}
function stateLabel(c){if(!c||!c.state)return'?';return `object flag ${c.state.obj?'kept (detected?)':'cleared'}, wall flag ${c.state.wall?'kept':'cleared'}`}
function draw(){let c=data[select.value];document.getElementById('explanation').textContent=c.explanation;for(const [panel,phase] of [['original','before'],['compared','after']]){let d=c[phase],p=document.getElementById(panel);p.querySelector('.num').textContent=step===0?`Depth ${d.setup?d.setup.olddepth:'?'} → ${d.setup?d.setup.curdepth:'?'}.`:stateLabel(d);p.querySelector('.state').textContent=step===0?'Both flags planted on the current panel.':'The new-level pass clears what it knows about.';p.querySelector('.action').textContent=step===1?stateLabel(d):'';document.getElementById(panel+'-log').textContent=d.raw}
document.getElementById('outcome').textContent=select.value==='new-level'?'The original keeps the stale object stamp; the correction clears it with the rest.':'Both versions agree in this control; the logs match byte for byte.';for(const b of document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]'))b.classList.toggle('active',Number(b.dataset.step)===step)}
select.addEventListener('change',()=>{step=1;draw()});for(const b of document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]'))b.addEventListener('click',()=>{step=Number(b.dataset.step);draw()});draw();</script></html>'''
(root/'replay.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(data).replace('<','\\u003c')))
(root/'replay-data.json').write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2)+'\n')
print('Open in your browser:',root/'replay.html')
